{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S01、尤其S05这类18—19秒的短屏里，未标“到时出现”的感受词仍然偏密，即使重点加亮，实际扫读压力也高于X。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y通过重点加亮和短句拆分，让观众更容易抓住心理转折，也更容易理解从怕给对方负担、不敢表达，到害怕失去、最终不再隐藏喜欢的因果链。按音乐小节出现的感受词，把声音变化与具体身体感受联系起来，细腻程度和前后呼应都更好。X的优势是清爽、扫读负担较低，但右侧感受词与人物心理之间的对应关系不如Y明确。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "601506fd-5622-4faa-baac-fa7b63567cb7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T181645902556Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.359, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:18:15.279844+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ffdb0f213602319f48eab0045640de5ecd60a5cec3927e3933e80936e0696ade", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedf